{"ID":"20240515131409-9cj2qbn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131409-9cj2qbn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131409-9cj2qbn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141029-483iq0u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141029-483iq0u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141029-483iq0u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:434,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:434\u0026#125;","title":"065","type":"doc","updated":"20240515171130"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515141029-483iq0u","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 791px;","id":"20240515141029-483iq0u","updated":"20240515171130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"37 胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/05"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兩個月前左乳頭正下發現硬塊"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月經準時，提前一天左右(師曰:人胖月經易提前)，月經前乳脹腫塊會痛，月經來後痛去"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"晚上睡時身熱，約下午七八點時身熱煩(師曰:陽不入陰)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可通宵睡"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴，欲飲冰水"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白天易累"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便正常"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左肋下方刺痛，一天痛一天不痛，不持續痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"額涼手溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩沉"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡白紅\n2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上焦濕熱重，胃火過盛"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方： \n1.石膏四兩，知母五錢，生地兩銭，天花三錢，麥冬三錢，旋覆花三錢，代赭石三錢，\n柴胡三錢，半夏三錢，茜草三錢，炒麥芽五錢，牡蠣一兩，川芎三錢，白芍三錢，\n當歸兩銭。\n共十五付，\n九碗煮成三碗，\n早晚餐前服。\n\n2.HT-2 退奶丸三兩，早晚餐後各三十粒，月經來時服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n陽明經熱白虎湯證，用石膏，知母。\n旋覆花，代赭石，柴胡，半夏，茜草治左肋下方痛(初診時為胰臟炎)。\n牡蠣鹹能軟堅，治乳下硬塊。\n四物湯加麥芽消乳房腫塊。\n天花粉，麥冬生津止渴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}